    <!--
        iOS Dependencies:
        EDM4U (External Dependency Manager for Unity) handles CocoaPods integration.
        CloudXCore is a dynamic framework. CloudXRenderer is no longer published.

        CloudXPostProcessiOS.cs handles:
        - Conditional framework embedding (based on Podfile configuration)
        - CloudX-specific SKAdNetwork IDs

        META ADAPTER USERS: If using CloudXMetaAdapter, configure EDM4U settings to
        avoid the FBAudienceNetwork static library crash. See README.md for details.
    -->
    <!--
        iOS Pods:
        EDM4U generates the Podfile from these entries.
        Pods are downloaded from CocoaPods trunk.
